OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy start with light rain or
OL,6,Fdrizzle for some, drier with cloud
OL,7,Fbreaking up in the afternoon. Feeling
OL,8,Fwarm for the time of year with
OL,9,Ftemperatures reaching the mid-
OL,10,Ftwenties. Cooler and breezier along
OL,11,Fthe coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain, possibly heavy at times, during
OL,15,Fthe second half of the night. A
OL,16,Fstrengthening southeasterly wind. A
OL,17,Fmild and muggy night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
