OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWet, cloudy and breezy
OL,6,Fstart but brightening up by the
OL,7,Fafternoon with the wind easing for a
OL,8,Ftime. Cloudier with the odd shower by
OL,9,Fthe evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FClear
OL,12,Fstart to Thursday, some patchy cloud
OL,13,Fdevelops later. Sharp showers
OL,14,Faffecting some on Friday. Cloudy
OL,15,Fperiods but remaining mostly dry on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
